# IVOA identifiers
#
# Persistent identifiers for IVOA RDF vocabularies and standards.
# - Redirects `https://w3id.org/ivoa/rdf/*` to `https://ivoa.net/rdf/*`
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Baptiste Cecconi
# baptiste.cecconi@obspm.fr
# GitHub username: BaptisteCecconi
#
# Dave Morris
# dave.morris@metagrid.co.uk
# GitHub username: Zarquan

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^rdf/(.*)$ https://ivoa.net/rdf/$1 [R=302,L]
